      "widgets_values": [
        "A single wide horizontal menu button for an illustrated mobile puzzle-adventure game, isolated on a flat warm light gray background. Orthographic straight-on front view. The button is a long rounded rectangle, approximately four times wider than tall, centered with generous clear space around it. The face is a smooth deep emerald green with an uninterrupted empty center reserved for a label. A thin warm ivory rim and an even muted antique gold outer border follow the same rounded rectangle. Clean readable silhouette, soft painted gradients, shallow bevel, restrained edge highlights and a small soft shadow beneath. Polished hand-painted casual puzzle game UI. The face and border are plain, with no text, symbols, logo, gems, or decorative protrusions."
      ]
